## Assumptions

- ABB is used as an illustrative traditional-bank case study; m10 is used
  as an illustrative fintech comparator. Neither company commissioned or
  reviewed this project.
- All customer data is synthetic and generated for demonstration purposes
  (see `notebooks/generate_data.py`).

## Constraints

- No access to real transactional or CRM data.
- Single-analyst project (no dedicated development, data engineering, or
  legal review team).

